// ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
// ┃  ZMK Corne Configuration                 ┃
// ┣━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┫
// ┃  Source of truth for the 42-key split    ┃
// ┃  layout. Includes 10 mod variants for    ┃
// ┃  fine-tuning via ZMK Studio.             ┃
// ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/outputs.h>

/ {
    /* --- MACROS --- */

    macros {
        macro_f_shifted: macro_f_shifted {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&none>;
            label = "MACRO_F_SHIFTED";
        };
    };

    behaviors {
        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Mod-morphs                              ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  context-aware keys for symbols and      ║
        // ║  navigation utility                      ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        mm_escape_grave: mm_escape_grave {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ESCAPE_GRAVE";
            bindings = <&kp ESC>, <&kp GRAVE>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_backspace_del: mm_backspace_del {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_BACKSPACE_DEL";
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>, <&kp DEL>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_round_bracket_left_exclaim: mm_round_bracket_left_exclaim {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ROUND_BRACKET_LEFT_EXCLAIM";
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS>, <&kp EXCLAMATION>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_round_bracket_right_exclaim: mm_round_bracket_right_exclaim {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ROUND_BRACKET_RIGHT_EXCLAIM";
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>, <&kp EXCLAMATION>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Tap-dances                              ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  multi-tap triggers for complex          ║
        // ║  modifiers and toggles                   ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        td_hyper_meh: td_hyper_meh {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_HYPER_MEH";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(LG(LEFT_SHIFT)))>, <&kp LA(LC(LEFT_SHIFT))>;

            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
        };

        td_meh_hyper: td_meh_hyper {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_MEH_HYPER";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(LEFT_SHIFT))>, <&kp LA(LC(LG(LEFT_SHIFT)))>;

            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
        };

        td_caps_word_lock: td_caps_word_lock {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_CAPS_WORD_LOCK";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&caps_word>, <&kp CAPSLOCK>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Home Row Mod Variants                   ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  ten distinct stages ranging from        ║
        // ║  slow/stable to fast/aggressive          ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
        // ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
        // │  These variants allow for finger-tuning  │
        // │  wirelessly via ZMK Studio. Stages 1-5   │
        // │  prioritise stability, while 6-10        │
        // │  optimise for high-speed bursts.         │
        // └──────────────────────────────────────────┘
        // › stage 1-3: the slow and steady tier

        hm_l_1: hm_l_1 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_1";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_1: hm_r_1 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_1";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_l_2: hm_l_2 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_2";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <275>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_2: hm_r_2 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_2";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <275>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_l_3: hm_l_3 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_3";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <250>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_3: hm_r_3 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_3";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <250>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        // › stage 4-7: the balanced middle ground

        hm_l_4: hm_l_4 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_4";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <225>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_4: hm_r_4 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_4";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <225>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_l_5: hm_l_5 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_5";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_5: hm_r_5 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_5";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_l_6: hm_l_6 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_6";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <185>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <125>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_6: hm_r_6 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_6";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <185>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <125>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_l_7: hm_l_7 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_7";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <125>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_7: hm_r_7 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_7";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <125>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        // › stage 8-10: the aggressive speed tiers

        hm_l_8: hm_l_8 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_8";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <160>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_8: hm_r_8 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_8";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <160>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_l_9: hm_l_9 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_9";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_9: hm_r_9 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_9";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_l_10: hm_l_10 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_L_10";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <135>;
            quick-tap-ms = <100>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        hm_r_10: hm_r_10 {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HM_R_10";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <135>;
            quick-tap-ms = <100>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <100>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Utility Hold-Taps                       ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  modifiers and layer shifts for thumbs   ║
        // ║  and utility keys                        ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        custom_layer_tap: custom_layer_tap {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CUSTOM_LAYER_TAP";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <200>;
        };

        custom_hold_tap: custom_hold_tap {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CUSTOM_HOLD_TAP";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
        };

        custom_hold_tap_retro: custom_hold_tap_retro {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CUSTOM_HOLD_TAP_RETRO";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            retro-tap;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        combo_jk_backspace {
            bindings = <&kp DEL>;
            key-positions = <19 20>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        main {
            display-name = "main";
            label = "main";
            bindings = <
&mm_escape_grave         &kp Q           &kp W           &kp E            &kp R            &kp T                        &kp Y                      &kp U                     &kp I                    &kp O           &kp P              &kp MINUS
&custom_layer_tap 2 TAB  &hm_l_5 LGUI A  &hm_l_5 LALT S  &hm_l_5 LCTRL D  &hm_l_5 LSHFT F  &kp G                        &kp H                      &hm_r_5 RSHFT J           &hm_r_5 RCTRL K          &hm_r_5 RALT L  &hm_r_5 RGUI SEMI  &kp SQT
&mt LSHFT ENTER          &kp Z           &kp X           &kp C            &kp V            &kp B                        &kp N                      &kp M                     &kp COMMA                &kp DOT         &kp SLASH          &kp ENTER
                                                         &td_meh_hyper    &td_hyper_meh    &custom_layer_tap 2 SPACE    &custom_layer_tap 2 SPACE  &custom_layer_tap 1 BSPC  &custom_layer_tap 2 DEL
            >;
        };

        movement {
            display-name = "movement";
            label = "movement";
            bindings = <
&kp GRAVE  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans    &trans  &trans     &trans  &trans
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp LEFT  &kp DOWN  &kp UP  &kp RIGHT  &trans  &trans
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans    &trans  &trans     &trans  &trans
                           &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans    &trans
            >;
        };

        number {
            display-name = "number";
            label = "number";
            bindings = <
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N7  &kp N8  &kp N9              &kp ASTRK  &kp LBKT                        &kp RBKT
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N4  &kp N5  &kp N6              &kp MINUS  &mm_round_bracket_left_exclaim  &mm_round_bracket_right_exclaim
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N1  &kp N2  &kp N3              &kp PLUS   &kp FSLH                        &kp BSLH
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &kp N0  &mt RSHFT KP_EQUAL
            >;
        };

        remote {
            display-name = "remote";
            label = "remote";
            bindings = <
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        gaming {
            display-name = "gaming";
            label = "gaming";
            bindings = <
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        transition {
            display-name = "transition";
            label = "transition";
            bindings = <
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &sl 6     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        io {
            display-name = "io";
            label = "io";
            bindings = <
&trans  &bt BT_DISC 0  &bt BT_DISC 1  &bt BT_DISC 2  &bt BT_DISC 3  &bt BT_DISC 4    &out OUT_TOG  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &bt BT_CLR
&trans  &bt BT_SEL 0   &bt BT_SEL 1   &bt BT_SEL 2   &bt BT_SEL 3   &bt BT_SEL 4     &trans        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans         &trans         &trans         &trans         &trans           &trans        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                      &trans         &trans         &trans           &trans        &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";

        tri_layer {
            if-layers = <1 2>;
            then-layer = <5>;
        };
    };
};
